### Test BookingService API with Repository Pattern

### 1. Check Storage Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/storage-type

### 2. Test endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/test

### 3. Get all rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/rooms

### 4. Get room amenities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/rooms/Deluxe/amenities

### 5. Check room availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/availability?roomType=Deluxe&checkIn=2024-01-15&checkOut=2024-01-17&rooms=1

### 6. Get all bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/all

### 7. Create a new booking (Single)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "checkIn": "2024-01-15T00:00:00",
  "checkOut": "2024-01-17T00:00:00",
  "username": "johndoe",
  "note": "Early check-in preferred",
  "numberOfRooms": 1,
  "roomType": "Deluxe",
  "adult": 2,
  "children": 1,
  "bookingType": "Single",
  "amenities": ["Wi-Fi", "TV", "Mini Bar"]
}

### 8. Create a recurring booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Smith",
  "checkIn": "2024-01-20T00:00:00",
  "checkOut": "2024-02-20T00:00:00",
  "username": "janesmith",
  "note": "Weekly business trip",
  "numberOfRooms": 1,
  "roomType": "Standard",
  "adult": 1,
  "children": 0,
  "bookingType": "Recurring",
  "frequency": "Weekly",
  "interval": 1,
  "days": ["Monday", "Wednesday", "Friday"]
}

### 9. Get user bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/user/johndoe

### 10. Get booking by ID (replace {bookingId} with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/{bookingId}

### 11. Update booking (replace {bookingId} with actual ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/{bookingId}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe Updated",
  "checkIn": "2024-01-15T00:00:00",
  "checkOut": "2024-01-18T00:00:00",
  "username": "johndoe",
  "note": "Updated note",
  "numberOfRooms": 2,
  "roomType": "Deluxe",
  "adult": 2,
  "children": 1,
  "bookingType": "Single",
  "amenities": ["Wi-Fi", "TV", "Mini Bar", "Ocean View"]
}

### 12. Delete booking (replace {bookingId} with actual ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/{bookingId}

### 13. Test Thread Safety (Concurrent Requests)
# This demonstrates thread-safe I/O operations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/booking/all

### Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7283 